  "description": "Feeling Lost? What to do now as the Stock Market Dices Up Investors",
  "body_html": "<p>The market has been volatile for roughly 3 weeks. That alone is shaking out newer investors. But volatility does not equal a bear market. There is currently no structural evidence that we have transitioned into a prolonged downturn. </p><p>This is the phase where future leaders begin, quietly, separating. I’ll show you those down below. </p><p>Some considerations right now:</p><ol><li><p>The VIX is elevated…LOCALLY. Short term and even mid-term traders are dealing with high volatility. But zooming out a bit, the VIX appears to be ranging in our favor. Lower highs and even a lower low that has formed. <strong>This signals to me another run upwards in the markets. </strong></p></li></ol><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cbvY!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd0006046-f87b-4050-a7e7-2c27b333aa3e_1267x821.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cbvY!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd0006046-f87b-4050-a7e7-2c27b333aa3e_1267x821.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cbvY!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd0006046-f87b-4050-a7e7-2c27b333aa3e_1267x821.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cbvY!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd0006046-f87b-4050-a7e7-2c27b333aa3e_1267x821.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cbvY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fi